<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Cathrine</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<pb n="172" facs="#f0194"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Cathrine</hi>. Da haben wirs. Das dacht&#x2019;<lb/>
