<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Dorchen</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<pb n="177" facs="#f0199"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Dorchen</hi>. O ja! es waren gar zu nied-<lb/>
