<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Vater</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<pb n="189" facs="#f0211"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Vater</hi>. Stille! &#x017F;tille! heute Mittag wol-<lb/>
