<fw type="sig" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#aq">II</hi> <hi rendition="#fr">Theil</hi>. Y</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Georg</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<pb n="338" facs="#f0360"/>
<p><hi rendition="#fr">Georg</hi>. Der alte Mann hat auch lauter<lb/>
